0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 429.00 Td (I used VLANs to separate different airport departments into different broadcast domains and) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 414.50 Td (security zones. This improves security, reduces unnecessary broadcast traffic, and makes) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 400.00 Td (troubleshooting easier.) Tj ET
0.080 0.200 0.340 rg
