0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 360.50 Td (802.1Q trunking allows multiple VLANs to travel over one physical link by adding VLAN tags to) Tj ET
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
BT /Helvetica 10.3 Tf 56.00 346.00 Td (Ethernet frames. In my lab, the trunk between the switch and router carries VLANs 10 through 70.) Tj ET
0.080 0.200 0.340 rg
